SUMMARY:Montclair Co-op Admissions Open House
DESCRIPTION:At Montclair Cooperative School\, we celebrate individuality\, learn by doing\, and keep the joy of learning alive. We intentionally delay technology and use it sparingly\, so kids spend their days building\, exploring\, creating\, and connecting with each other. \nJoin us for our Admissions Open House on Saturday\, October 17th. Meet our teachers\, talk with current Co-op families\, and tour our beautiful campus. Bring the whole family and see for yourself! \nRSVP to attend: https://c6ieh.share.hsforms.com/2Vf8qFYCITwCsvkM0n8nYDA \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
