SUMMARY:Montclair Zombie Walk
DESCRIPTION:Join East Side Mages and Indie Arts Montclair for the annual Montclair Zombie Walk! Make up appointments start at 2:00 pm and the walks starts at 5:30 pm SHARP at East Side Mags!\nIndie Arts Montclair will have some super-scary merch available including our awesome OFFICIAL ZOMBIE WALK T-SHIRTS (limited quantities\, sizes)! All proceeds from merch sales go to support IAM. \nMR HAUNT will be judging a costume contest after the walk so if you’ve got your Halloween costume ready\, come dressed to scare and we’ll “zombify” your costume and you could win some fabulous prizes! \nNOTORIOUS BBQ will be here with “zombowls” aka small bowls topped with slaw and their signature BBQ sauce with your choice of brisket\, pulled pork or portabello mushroom as a base! Support local business! Support your friends! This food is seriously AMAZING! \nWe can’t wait for another amazing Zombie Walk! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
