DESCRIPTION:Get crafty and create your own signature scents and stunning designs at our Paint & Pour Candle Making Class! Learn the art of making luxurious coconut wax candles and personalize your container with vibrant painted artwork. It’s a hands-on experience where your creativity takes center stage. Please remember the image is just an inspiration – your final creation will be uniquely yours! \nStudents should wear something they don’t mind getting messy. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
