SUMMARY:BluLotus Pizza at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:BluLotus Pizza offers handcrafted pizzas inspired by Neapolitan tradition\, New York energy\, South Asian flavors\, Mediterranean ingredients\, and the kind of food you actually crave after one bite. Their dough is slow-fermented for flavor and texture\, then baked hot for a light\, airy crust with just the right amount of char. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
