SUMMARY:Forever Welded Jewelry Halloween Party
DESCRIPTION:Join us this weekend for drinks & treats in celebration of the spooky season! We’ll have some of our favorite vendors in-store and special jewelry deals just for you. \nAppointments are not required\, but definitely recommended. We can’t wait to see you there! \nStore Hours:\nSaturday\, October 17th: 11:00AM – 7:00PM\nSunday\, October 18th: 11:00AM – 5:00PM \nAbout Forever Welded Jewelry\nForever Welded Jewelry was born from a passion for creating meaningful\, lasting jewelry. What started as a small artisan Etsy shop\, grew into a love for permanent welded jewelry\, and has now fully grown into a luxury bespoke jewelry experience. \nEvery piece we create is designed to tell a story. Whether it’s commemorating an anniversary\, celebrating a friendship\, or simply treating yourself—we craft jewelry that becomes part of your everyday life. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
