SUMMARY:Kill Goofy
DESCRIPTION:Apricot Sky Productions’s new play\, Kill Goofy by Livingston playwright Eric Alter\, opens October 9 and plays for three weekends throught October 25. \nThe story is simple on the surface. Two best friends\, inseparable at thirteen\, haven’t spoken in thirty years. One of them never left his childhood bedroom. His mother never left because someone had to take care of him. Then the other one comes back to town\, and everyone in that house has been keeping the same secret. It’s a play about the things we never say to the people closest to us\, and it sends people out the door talking. \nPlease note the play deals with difficult subject matter and is recommended for ages 15 and up. The full synopsis and content advisory plus more information are at https://apricotskyproductions.com/killgoofy. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/kill-goofy/2026-10-18/
