SUMMARY:NJBS Blues & Brews: Iron Mountain Blues Band live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the next installment of our monthly collab with the North Jersey Blues Society known as Blues + Brews. One Sunday a month\, we collaborate to bring the Blues to Montclair. Next up – Iron Mountain Blues Band! \nCome rock out to funky blues and rock tunes by these great local musicians! \n$10 cover charge per person that goes directly to the North Jersey Blues Society. \nThe mission of the North Jersey Blues Society is to celebrate the heritage of blues music through the unity of fans\, musicians\, society members\, venues\, and business owners who will collaborate and promote the blues in Northern New Jersey. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
